{"seq":3,"slug":"e-commerce","title":"电子商务","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"电子商务-简介\">电子商务 简介</h1><p>电子商务是中等职业教育中最贴近数字经济时代的专业方向之一，专业代码 730701，面向初中毕业生开设三年制培养计划。本专业紧跟产业发展脉搏，将传统商务理论与互联网技术深度融合，培养能够胜任网站建设与维护、网络营销与推广、网店经营与管理等岗位的高素质技术技能人才。</p>\n<p>2026年的电商行业正经历深刻变革：短视频电商与直播带货已成为主流销售渠道，AI内容生成工具重塑了营销内容的生产方式，数据驱动运营贯穿了从选品到售后的全链路。中职电商专业的教学内容也随之迭代更新，既保留扎实的商务基础，又纳入前沿的技术工具与运营方法。</p>\n<p>本专业课程体系分为四大核心模块：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 电商基础</strong> 系统讲授电子商务的基本模式与主流平台规则，帮助学生理解 B2B、B2C、C2C、O2O 等商业逻辑，掌握在线支付与物流体系的运转机制，建立电商法律意识与职业道德观念。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 网店运营</strong> 聚焦实操技能训练，从商品拍摄与上架、店铺视觉设计到客户服务与关系管理，完整覆盖一家网店日常运营的核心环节，培养学生独立管理店铺的能力。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 数字营销</strong> 深入讲解 SEO/SEM 推广策略、社交媒体营销方法与数据化运营体系，让学生学会用数据指导决策、用工具放大流量价值。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 新媒体与直播</strong> 紧跟行业最新趋势，系统训练短视频创作、直播电商实操以及 AI 工具在内容营销中的应用，使学生具备全媒体运营的综合素养。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：先从第一章建立理论框架，再通过第二章进行实操入门，第三章拓展营销视野，最后在第四章掌握前沿工具与玩法。学习过程中应结合真实店铺运营实践，在做中学、在学中做，逐步积累项目经验。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-fundamentals","title":"电商基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/ecommerce-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-models-platforms","title":"电商模式与平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/ecommerce-fundamentals/ecommerce-models-platforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"online-payment-logistics","title":"在线支付与物流","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/ecommerce-fundamentals/online-payment-logistics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecommerce-law-ethics","title":"电商法律与职业道德","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/ecommerce-fundamentals/ecommerce-law-ethics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"online-store-operations","title":"网店运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/online-store-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-listing-photography","title":"商品上架与拍摄","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/online-store-operations/product-listing-photography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"store-decoration-design","title":"店铺装修与视觉设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/online-store-operations/store-decoration-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"customer-service-crm","title":"客户服务与关系管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/online-store-operations/customer-service-crm"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-marketing","title":"数字营销","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/digital-marketing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"seo-sem-basics","title":"SEO与SEM基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/digital-marketing/seo-sem-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-marketing","title":"社交媒体营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/digital-marketing/social-media-marketing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-driven-operations","title":"数据化运营","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/digital-marketing/data-driven-operations"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"new-media-livestream","title":"新媒体与直播","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/new-media-livestream","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"short-video-creation","title":"短视频创作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/new-media-livestream/short-video-creation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"livestream-commerce","title":"直播电商实操","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/new-media-livestream/livestream-commerce"},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-marketing-ai","title":"内容营销与AI工具","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/e-commerce/new-media-livestream/content-marketing-ai"}]}]}